#: ../../library/zlib.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`!zlib` --- Compression compatible with :program:`gzip`"
msgstr ":mod:`!zlib` --- Komprese kompatibilní s :program:`gzip`"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:10
msgid ""
"For applications that require data compression, the functions in this module"
" allow compression and decompression, using the `zlib library "
"<https://www.zlib.net>`_."
msgstr ""
"Pro aplikace vyžadující kompresi dat umožňují funkce v tomto modulu kompresi"
" a dekompresi pomocí `knihovny zlib <https://www.zlib.net>`_."

#: ../../includes/optional-module.rst:1
msgid ""
"This is an :term:`optional module`. If it is missing from your copy of "
"CPython, look for documentation from your distributor (that is, whoever "
"provided Python to you). If you are the distributor, see :ref:`optional-"
"module-requirements`."
msgstr ""
"Toto je :term:`volitelný modul`. Pokud chybí ve vašem Pythonu, vyhledejte "
"dokumentaci od distributora (tedy od toho, kdo vám Python poskytl). Pokud "
"jste distributor, podívejte se na :ref:`optional-module-requirements`."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:15
msgid ""
"zlib's functions have many options and often need to be used in a particular"
" order.  This documentation doesn't attempt to cover all of the "
"permutations; consult the `zlib manual <https://www.zlib.net/manual.html>`_ "
"for authoritative information."
msgstr ""
"Funkce zlib mají mnoho možností a často je třeba je používat v konkrétním "
"pořadí. Tato dokumentace se nesnaží pokrýt všechny permutace; podrobnější "
"informace najdete v `manuálu zlib <https://www.zlib.net/manual.html>`_."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:20
msgid "For reading and writing ``.gz`` files see the :mod:`gzip` module."
msgstr "Pro čtení a zápis souborů ``.gz`` viz modul :mod:`gzip`."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:22
msgid "The available exception and functions in this module are:"
msgstr "Dostupné výjimky a funkce v tomto modulu jsou:"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:27
msgid "Exception raised on compression and decompression errors."
msgstr "Výjimka vyvolaná při chybách komprese a dekomprese."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:32
msgid ""
"Computes an Adler-32 checksum of *data*.  (An Adler-32 checksum is almost as"
" reliable as a CRC32 but can be computed much more quickly.)  The result is "
"an unsigned 32-bit integer.  If *value* is present, it is used as the "
"starting value of the checksum; otherwise, a default value of 1 is used.  "
"Passing in *value* allows computing a running checksum over the "
"concatenation of several inputs.  The algorithm is not cryptographically "
"strong, and should not be used for authentication or digital signatures.  "
"Since the algorithm is designed for use as a checksum algorithm, it is not "
"suitable for use as a general hash algorithm."
msgstr ""
"Vypočítá kontrolní součet Adler-32 dat *data*. (Kontrolní součet Adler-32 je"
" téměř stejně spolehlivý jako CRC32, ale lze jej vypočítat mnohemlem "
"rychleji.) Výsledkem je 32-bitové celé číslo bez znaménka. Pokud je přítomen"
" *value*, je použit jako počáteční hodnota kontrolního součtu; jinak se "
"používá výchozí hodnota 1. Předání *value* umožňuje výčet bežžicího "
"kontrolního součtu přes spojení několika vstupů. Algoritmus není "
"kryptograficky silný a neměl by se používat k authentifikaci nebo digitálním"
" podpisů. Vzhledem k tomu, že je algoritmus navrhén pro použití jako "
"algoritmus kontrolního součtu, není vhodný pro použití jako obecný hash "
"algoritmus."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:42 ../../library/zlib.rst:131
msgid "The result is always unsigned."
msgstr "Výsledkem je vždy číslo bez znaménka."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:47
msgid ""
"Compresses the bytes in *data*, returning a bytes object containing "
"compressed data. *level* is an integer from ``0`` to ``9`` or ``-1`` "
"controlling the level of compression; See :const:`Z_BEST_SPEED` (``1``), "
":const:`Z_BEST_COMPRESSION` (``9``), :const:`Z_NO_COMPRESSION` (``0``), and "
"the default, :const:`Z_DEFAULT_COMPRESSION` (``-1``) for more information "
"about these values."
msgstr ""
"Komprimuje bajty v *data* a vrací objekt bytes obsahující komprimovaná data."
" *level* je celé číslo od ``0`` do ``9`` nebo ``-1`` určující úroveň "
"komprese; podrobnější informace o těchto hodnotách viz :const:`Z_BEST_SPEED`"
" (``1``), :const:`Z_BEST_COMPRESSION` (``9``), :const:`Z_NO_COMPRESSION` "
"(``0``) a výchozí :const:`Z_DEFAULT_COMPRESSION` (``-1``)."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:55
msgid ""
"The *wbits* argument controls the size of the history buffer (or the "
"\"window size\") used when compressing data, and whether a header and "
"trailer is included in the output.  It can take several ranges of values, "
"defaulting to ``15`` (:const:`MAX_WBITS`):"
msgstr ""
"Argument *wbits* kontroluje velikost vyrovnávací paměti historie (nebo "
"\"velikost okna\") používané při kompresi dat a zda je výstup doplněn "
"záhlavím a závěřcem. Může nabývat několika rozsahů hodnot, výděláná na "
"``15`` (:const:`MAX_WBITS`):"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:60
msgid ""
"+9 to +15: The base-two logarithm of the window size, which therefore ranges"
" between 512 and 32768.  Larger values produce better compression at the "
"expense of greater memory usage.  The resulting output will include a zlib-"
"specific header and trailer."
msgstr ""
"+9 až +15: Logaritmus o základě 2 velikosti okna, která se tedy pohybuje "
"mezi 512 a 32768. Větší hodnoty poskytují lepší kompresi na úhu větší "
"spotřeby paměti. Výstup bude obsahovat záhlaví a závěř specifické pro zlib."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:65
msgid ""
"−9 to −15: Uses the absolute value of *wbits* as the window size logarithm, "
"while producing a raw output stream with no header or trailing checksum."
msgstr ""
"−9 až −15: Používá absolutní hodnotu *wbits* jako logaritmus velikosti okna,"
" přičemž vytváří surový výstupní proud bez záhlaví nebo koncového "
"kontrolního součtu."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:69
msgid ""
"+25 to +31 = 16 + (9 to 15): Uses the low 4 bits of the value as the window "
"size logarithm, while including a basic :program:`gzip` header and trailing "
"checksum in the output."
msgstr ""
"+25 až +31 = 16 + (9 až 15): Používá dolní 4 bity hodnoty jako logaritmus "
"velikosti okna a zahrnuje základní záhlaví :program:`gzip` a koncový "
"kontrolní součet ve výstupu."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:73
msgid "Raises the :exc:`error` exception if any error occurs."
msgstr "Vyvolejí výjimku :exc:`error`, pokud dojde k chybě."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:75
msgid "*level* can now be used as a keyword parameter."
msgstr "*level* lze nyní použít jako parametr klíčového slova."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:78
msgid ""
"The *wbits* parameter is now available to set window bits and compression "
"type."
msgstr ""
"Parametr *wbits* je nyní k dispozici pro nastavení bitů okna a typu "
"komprese."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:84
msgid ""
"Returns a compression object, to be used for compressing data streams that "
"won't fit into memory at once."
msgstr ""
"Vrací objekt komprese, který se má použít pro kompresi toků dat, které se "
"nevejdou do paměti najednou."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:87
msgid ""
"*level* is the compression level -- an integer from ``0`` to ``9`` or "
"``-1``. See :const:`Z_BEST_SPEED` (``1``), :const:`Z_BEST_COMPRESSION` "
"(``9``), :const:`Z_NO_COMPRESSION` (``0``), and the default, "
":const:`Z_DEFAULT_COMPRESSION` (``-1``) for more information about these "
"values."
msgstr ""
"*level* je úroveň komprese -- celé číslo od ``0`` do ``9`` nebo ``-1``. "
"Podrobnější informace o těchto hodnotách viz :const:`Z_BEST_SPEED` (``1``), "
":const:`Z_BEST_COMPRESSION` (``9``), :const:`Z_NO_COMPRESSION` (``0``) a "
"výchozí :const:`Z_DEFAULT_COMPRESSION` (``-1``)."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:92
msgid ""
"*method* is the compression algorithm. Currently, the only supported value "
"is :const:`DEFLATED`."
msgstr ""
"*method* je algoritmus komprese. V současnosti je jedinou podporovanou "
"hodnotou :const:`DEFLATED`."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:95
msgid ""
"The *wbits* parameter controls the size of the history buffer (or the "
"\"window size\"), and what header and trailer format will be used. It has "
"the same meaning as `described for compress() <#compress-wbits>`__."
msgstr ""
"Parametr *wbits* ridi velikost bufferu historie (nebo \"velikost okna\") a "
"jaky format hlavicky a paticky bude pouzit. Ma stejny vyznam jako `popsany "
"pro compress() <#compress-wbits>`__."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:99
msgid ""
"The *memLevel* argument controls the amount of memory used for the internal "
"compression state. Valid values range from ``1`` to ``9``. Higher values use"
" more memory, but are faster and produce smaller output."
msgstr ""
"Parametr *memLevel* ridi mnozstvi pameti pouzite pro interni stav komprese. "
"Platne hodnoty jsou v rozsahu ``1`` az ``9``. Vyssi hodnoty pouzivaji vice "
"pameti, ale jsou rychlejsi a produkuji mensi vystup."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:103
msgid ""
"*strategy* is used to tune the compression algorithm. Possible values are "
":const:`Z_DEFAULT_STRATEGY`, :const:`Z_FILTERED`, :const:`Z_HUFFMAN_ONLY`, "
":const:`Z_RLE` and :const:`Z_FIXED`."
msgstr ""
"*strategy* slouzi k ladeni kompresniho algoritmu. Mozne hodnoty jsou "
":const:`Z_DEFAULT_STRATEGY`, :const:`Z_FILTERED`, :const:`Z_HUFFMAN_ONLY`, "
":const:`Z_RLE` a :const:`Z_FIXED`."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:107
msgid ""
"*zdict* is a predefined compression dictionary. This is a sequence of bytes "
"(such as a :class:`bytes` object) containing subsequences that are expected "
"to occur frequently in the data that is to be compressed. Those subsequences"
" that are expected to be most common should come at the end of the "
"dictionary."
msgstr ""
"*zdict* je preddefinovany kompresni slovnik. Jedna se o sekvenci bytu (jako "
"napr. objekt :class:`bytes`) obsahujici podsekvence, ktere se ocekavaji v "
"datech urcených ke kompresi. Podsekvence, ktere se ocekavaji nejcasteji, by "
"mely byt na konci slovniku."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:112
msgid "Added the *zdict* parameter and keyword argument support."
msgstr "Pridan parametr *zdict* a podpora klicovych argumentu."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:122
msgid ""
"Computes a CRC (Cyclic Redundancy Check) checksum of *data*. The result is "
"an unsigned 32-bit integer. If *value* is present, it is used as the "
"starting value of the checksum; otherwise, a default value of 0 is used.  "
"Passing in *value* allows computing a running checksum over the "
"concatenation of several inputs.  The algorithm is not cryptographically "
"strong, and should not be used for authentication or digital signatures.  "
"Since the algorithm is designed for use as a checksum algorithm, it is not "
"suitable for use as a general hash algorithm."
msgstr ""
"Vypocita CRC (Cyclic Redundancy Check) kontrolni soucet dat *data*. Vysledek"
" je 32-bitove cislo bez znamenka. Pokud je zadana hodnota *value*, pouzije "
"se jako pocatecni hodnota kontrolniho souctu; jinak se pouzije vychozi "
"hodnota 0. Predani *value* umoznuje vypocitat prubezny kontrolni soucet pres"
" spojeni nekolika vstupu. Algoritmus neni kryptograficky silny a nemelo by "
"se pouzivat pro autentizaci nebo digitalni podpisy. Protoze je algoritmus "
"navrzeny pro pouziti jako algoritmus kontrolniho souctu, neni vhodny pro "
"pouziti jako obecny hashovaci algoritmus."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:136
msgid ""
"Decompresses the bytes in *data*, returning a bytes object containing the "
"uncompressed data.  The *wbits* parameter depends on the format of *data*, "
"and is discussed further below. If *bufsize* is given, it is used as the "
"initial size of the output buffer.  Raises the :exc:`error` exception if any"
" error occurs."
msgstr ""
"Dekomprimuje byty v *data* a vraci objekt bytes obsahujici nekomprimovana "
"data. Parametr *wbits* zavisi na formatu *data* a je probrany nize. Pokud je"
" zadano *bufsize*, pouzije se jako pocatecni velikost vystupniho bufferu. "
"Vyvola vyjimku :exc:`error`, pokud dojde k chybe."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:144
msgid ""
"The *wbits* parameter controls the size of the history buffer (or \"window "
"size\"), and what header and trailer format is expected. It is similar to "
"the parameter for :func:`compressobj`, but accepts more ranges of values:"
msgstr ""
"Parametr *wbits* ridi velikost bufferu historie (nebo \"velikost okna\") a "
"jaky format hlavicky a paticky se ocekava. Je podobny parametru pro "
":func:`compressobj`, ale akceptuje sirsi rozsah hodnot:"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:149
msgid ""
"+8 to +15: The base-two logarithm of the window size.  The input must "
"include a zlib header and trailer."
msgstr ""
"+8 az +15: Logaritmus o zakladu dva velikosti okna. Vstup musi obsahovat "
"zlib hlavicku a paticku."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:152
msgid ""
"0: Automatically determine the window size from the zlib header. Only "
"supported since zlib 1.2.3.5."
msgstr ""
"0: Automaticky urci velikost okna ze zlib hlavicky. Podporovano pouze od "
"zlib 1.2.3.5."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:155
msgid ""
"−8 to −15: Uses the absolute value of *wbits* as the window size logarithm."
"  The input must be a raw stream with no header or trailer."
msgstr ""
"−8 az −15: Pouzije absolutni hodnotu *wbits* jako logaritmus velikosti okna."
" Vstup musi byt surovy stream bez hlavicky nebo paticky."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:158
msgid ""
"+24 to +31 = 16 + (8 to 15): Uses the low 4 bits of the value as the window "
"size logarithm.  The input must include a gzip header and trailer."
msgstr ""
"+24 az +31 = 16 + (8 az 15): Pouzije spodni 4 bity hodnoty jako logaritmus "
"velikosti okna. Vstup musi obsahovat gzip hlavicku a paticku."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:162
msgid ""
"+40 to +47 = 32 + (8 to 15): Uses the low 4 bits of the value as the window "
"size logarithm, and automatically accepts either the zlib or gzip format."
msgstr ""
"+40 az +47 = 32 + (8 az 15): Pouzije spodni 4 bity hodnoty jako logaritmus "
"velikosti okna a automaticky akceptuje bud zlib nebo gzip format."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:166
msgid ""
"When decompressing a stream, the window size must not be smaller than the "
"size originally used to compress the stream; using a too-small value may "
"result in an :exc:`error` exception. The default *wbits* value corresponds "
"to the largest window size and requires a zlib header and trailer to be "
"included."
msgstr ""
"Pri dekompresi streamu nesmi byt velikost okna mensi nez velikost puvodni "
"pouzita ke kompresi streamu; pouziti prilis male hodnoty muze vest k vyjimce"
" :exc:`error`. Vychozi hodnota *wbits* odpovida nejvetsi velikosti okna a "
"vyzaduje zlib hlavicku a paticku."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:172
msgid ""
"*bufsize* is the initial size of the buffer used to hold decompressed data."
"  If more space is required, the buffer size will be increased as needed, so"
" you don't have to get this value exactly right; tuning it will only save a "
"few calls to :c:func:`malloc`."
msgstr ""
"*bufsize* je pocatecni velikost bufferu pouziteho pro uchovavani "
"dekomprimovanych dat. Pokud je zapotrebi vice mista, velikost bufferu se "
"podle potreby zvysi, takze nemusite ziskat tuto hodnotu presne; ladenim "
"uspornite jen par volani :c:func:`malloc`."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:177
msgid "*wbits* and *bufsize* can be used as keyword arguments."
msgstr "*wbits* a *bufsize* lze pouzit jako klicove argumenty."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:182
msgid ""
"Returns a decompression object, to be used for decompressing data streams "
"that won't fit into memory at once."
msgstr ""
"Vraci dekompresni objekt pro dekompresi datovych streamu, ktere se nevejdou "
"do pameti najednou."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:185
msgid ""
"The *wbits* parameter controls the size of the history buffer (or the "
"\"window size\"), and what header and trailer format is expected.  It has "
"the same meaning as `described for decompress() <#decompress-wbits>`__."
msgstr ""
"Parametr *wbits* ridi velikost bufferu historie (nebo \"velikost okna\") a "
"jaky format hlavicky a paticky se ocekava. Ma stejny vyznam jako `popsany "
"pro decompress() <#decompress-wbits>`__."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:189
msgid ""
"The *zdict* parameter specifies a predefined compression dictionary. If "
"provided, this must be the same dictionary as was used by the compressor "
"that produced the data that is to be decompressed."
msgstr ""
"Parametr *zdict* specifikuje preddefinovany kompresni slovnik. Pokud je "
"poskytnuto, musi to byt stejny slovnik, jaky byl pouzit kompresorem, ktery "
"vytvoril data urcena k dekompresi."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:195
msgid ""
"If *zdict* is a mutable object (such as a :class:`bytearray`), you must not "
"modify its contents between the call to :func:`decompressobj` and the first "
"call to the decompressor's ``decompress()`` method."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je *zdict* menitelny objekt (jako :class:`bytearray`), nesmi jeho "
"obsah modifikovat mezi volanim :func:`decompressobj` a prvnim volanim metody"
" ``decompress()`` dekompresoru."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:199
msgid "Added the *zdict* parameter."
msgstr "Pridan parametr *zdict*."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:203
msgid "Compression objects support the following methods:"
msgstr "Kompresni objekty podporuji nasledujici metody:"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:208
msgid ""
"Compress *data*, returning a bytes object containing compressed data for at "
"least part of the data in *data*.  This data should be concatenated to the "
"output produced by any preceding calls to the :meth:`compress` method.  Some"
" input may be kept in internal buffers for later processing."
msgstr ""
"Komprimuje *data* a vraci objekt bytes obsahujici komprimovana data alespon "
"casti dat v *data*. Tato data by mela byt spojena s vystupem vytvorenym "
"predchozimi volanimi metody :meth:`compress`. Nektere vstupy mohou byt "
"uchovavany v internich bufferech pro pozdejsi zpracovani."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:216
msgid ""
"All pending input is processed, and a bytes object containing the remaining "
"compressed output is returned.  *mode* can be selected from the constants "
":const:`Z_NO_FLUSH`, :const:`Z_PARTIAL_FLUSH`, :const:`Z_SYNC_FLUSH`, "
":const:`Z_FULL_FLUSH`, :const:`Z_BLOCK`, or :const:`Z_FINISH`, defaulting to"
" :const:`Z_FINISH`.  Except :const:`Z_FINISH`, all constants allow "
"compressing further bytestrings of data, while :const:`Z_FINISH` finishes "
"the compressed stream and prevents compressing any more data.  After calling"
" :meth:`flush` with *mode* set to :const:`Z_FINISH`, the :meth:`compress` "
"method cannot be called again; the only realistic action is to delete the "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Vsechny cekajici vstupy jsou zpracovany a je vracen objekt bytes obsahujici "
"zbyvajici komprimovany vystup. *mode* lze vybrat z konstant "
":const:`Z_NO_FLUSH`, :const:`Z_PARTIAL_FLUSH`, :const:`Z_SYNC_FLUSH`, "
":const:`Z_FULL_FLUSH`, :const:`Z_BLOCK` nebo :const:`Z_FINISH`, s vychozi "
"hodnotou :const:`Z_FINISH`. Krome :const:`Z_FINISH` vsechny konstanty "
"umoznuji dale komprimovat bytestrings dat, zatimco :const:`Z_FINISH` dokonci"
" komprimovany stream a zabrani dalsi kompresi dat. Po zavolani :meth:`flush`"
" s *mode* nastavenym na :const:`Z_FINISH` nesmi byt metoda :meth:`compress` "
"znovu zavolana; jedinou realistickou akci je smazat objekt."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:229
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the compression object.  This can be used to efficiently "
"compress a set of data that share a common initial prefix."
msgstr ""
"Vraci kopii kompresniho objektu. To lze pouzit k efektivni kompresi sady "
"dat, ktera sdilejí spolecny pocatecni prefix."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:233
msgid ""
"Added :func:`copy.copy` and :func:`copy.deepcopy` support to compression "
"objects."
msgstr ""
"Pridana podpora :func:`copy.copy` a :func:`copy.deepcopy` pro kompresni "
"objekty."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:238
msgid "Decompression objects support the following methods and attributes:"
msgstr "Dekompresni objekty podporuji nasledujici metody a atributy:"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:243
msgid ""
"A bytes object which contains any bytes past the end of the compressed data."
" That is, this remains ``b\"\"`` until the last byte that contains "
"compression data is available.  If the whole bytestring turned out to "
"contain compressed data, this is ``b\"\"``, an empty bytes object."
msgstr ""
"Objekt bytes, ktery obsahuje byty za koncem komprimovanych dat. To znamena, "
"ze zustava ``b\"\"`` az do posledniho bytu, ktery obsahuje komprimovana "
"data. Pokud cely bytestring obsahoval komprimovana data, je to ``b\"\"``, "
"prazdny objekt bytes."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:251
msgid ""
"A bytes object that contains any data that was not consumed by the last "
":meth:`decompress` call because it exceeded the limit for the uncompressed "
"data buffer.  This data has not yet been seen by the zlib machinery, so you "
"must feed it (possibly with further data concatenated to it) back to a "
"subsequent :meth:`decompress` method call in order to get correct output."
msgstr ""
"Objekt bytes, ktery obsahuje data, ktera nebyla zpracovana poslednim volanim"
" :meth:`decompress`, protoze prekrocila limit bufferu nekomprimovanych dat. "
"Tato data jeste nebyla zpracovana zlib, takze je musite predat (mozna s "
"dalsimi daty) zpet do nasledujiciho volani metody :meth:`decompress`, abyste"
" ziskali spravny vystup."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:260
msgid ""
"A boolean indicating whether the end of the compressed data stream has been "
"reached."
msgstr ""
"Boolean indikujici, zda byl dosazen konec komprimovaneho datoveho streamu."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:263
msgid ""
"This makes it possible to distinguish between a properly formed compressed "
"stream, and an incomplete or truncated one."
msgstr ""
"To umoznuje rozlisit mezi spravne vytvoreny komprimovany stream a "
"nekomplenim nebo zkracenym."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:271
msgid ""
"Decompress *data*, returning a bytes object containing the uncompressed data"
" corresponding to at least part of the data in *string*.  This data should "
"be concatenated to the output produced by any preceding calls to the "
":meth:`decompress` method.  Some of the input data may be preserved in "
"internal buffers for later processing."
msgstr ""
"Dekomprimuje *data* a vraci objekt bytes obsahujici nekomprimovana data "
"odpovidajici alespon casti dat v *string*. Tato data by mela byt spojena s "
"vystupem vytvorenym predchozimi volanimi metody :meth:`decompress`. Cast "
"vstupnich dat muze byt uchovana v internich bufferech pro pozdejsi "
"zpracovani."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:277
msgid ""
"If the optional parameter *max_length* is non-zero then the return value "
"will be no longer than *max_length*. This may mean that not all of the "
"compressed input can be processed; and unconsumed data will be stored in the"
" attribute :attr:`unconsumed_tail`. This bytestring must be passed to a "
"subsequent call to :meth:`decompress` if decompression is to continue.  If "
"*max_length* is zero then the whole input is decompressed, and "
":attr:`unconsumed_tail` is empty."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je volitelny parametr *max_length* nenulovy, navratova hodnota nebude "
"delsi nez *max_length*. To muze znamenat, ze ne vsechny komprimovane vstupy "
"mohou byt zpracovany; nespotrebovana data budou ulozena v atributu "
":attr:`unconsumed_tail`. Tento bytestring musi byt predan nasledujicimu "
"volani :meth:`decompress`, pokud ma dekomprese pokracovat. Pokud je "
"*max_length* nula, cely vstup je dekomprimovan a :attr:`unconsumed_tail` je "
"prazdny."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:284
msgid "*max_length* can be used as a keyword argument."
msgstr "*max_length* lze pouzit jako klicovy argument."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:290
msgid ""
"All pending input is processed, and a bytes object containing the remaining "
"uncompressed output is returned.  After calling :meth:`flush`, the "
":meth:`decompress` method cannot be called again; the only realistic action "
"is to delete the object."
msgstr ""
"Vsechny cekajici vstupy jsou zpracovany a je vracen objekt bytes obsahujici "
"zbyvajici nekomprimovany vystup. Po zavolani :meth:`flush` nesmi byt metoda "
":meth:`decompress` znovu zavolana; jedinou realistickou akci je smazat "
"objekt."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:295
msgid ""
"The optional parameter *length* sets the initial size of the output buffer."
msgstr ""
"Volitelny parametr *length* nastavuje pocatecni velikost vystupniho bufferu."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:300
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the decompression object.  This can be used to save the "
"state of the decompressor midway through the data stream in order to speed "
"up random seeks into the stream at a future point."
msgstr ""
"Vraci kopii dekompresniho objektu. To lze pouzit k ulozeni stavu "
"dekompresoru uprostred datoveho streamu, aby se zrychlilo nahodne "
"vyhledavani ve streamu v budoucnu."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:305
msgid ""
"Added :func:`copy.copy` and :func:`copy.deepcopy` support to decompression "
"objects."
msgstr ""
"Pridana podpora :func:`copy.copy` a :func:`copy.deepcopy` pro dekompresni "
"objekty."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:310
msgid ""
"The following constants are available to configure compression and "
"decompression behavior:"
msgstr ""
"Nasledujici konstanty jsou k dispozici pro konfiguraci chovani komprese a "
"dekomprese:"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:315
msgid "The deflate compression method."
msgstr "Metoda deflate komprese."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:320
msgid ""
"The maximum window size, expressed as a power of 2. For example, if "
":const:`!MAX_WBITS` is ``15`` it results in a window size of ``32 KiB``."
msgstr ""
"Maximalni velikost okna, vyjadrena jako mocnina 2. Napr. pokud je "
":const:`!MAX_WBITS` ``15``, vysledkem je velikost okna ``32 KiB``."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:327
msgid "The default memory level for compression objects."
msgstr "Vychozi uroven pameti pro kompresni objekty."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:332
msgid "The default buffer size for decompression operations."
msgstr "Vychozi velikost bufferu pro dekompresni operace."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:337
msgid "Compression level ``0``; no compression."
msgstr "Uroven komprese ``0``; zadna komprese."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:344
msgid "Compression level ``1``; fastest and produces the least compression."
msgstr "Uroven komprese ``1``; nejrychlejsi a produkuje nejmene komprese."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:349
msgid "Compression level ``9``; slowest and produces the most compression."
msgstr "Uroven komprese ``9``; nejpomalejsi a produkuje nejvice komprese."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:354
msgid ""
"Default compression level (``-1``); a compromise between speed and "
"compression. Currently equivalent to compression level ``6``."
msgstr ""
"Vychozi uroven komprese (``-1``); kompromis mezi rychlosti a kompresi. "
"Momentalne ekvivalentni urovni komprese ``6``."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:360
msgid "Default compression strategy, for normal data."
msgstr "Vychozi kompresni strategie pro normalni data."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:365
msgid "Compression strategy for data produced by a filter (or predictor)."
msgstr "Kompresni strategie pro data vytvorena filtrem (nebo prediktorem)."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:370
msgid "Compression strategy that forces Huffman coding only."
msgstr "Kompresni strategie, ktera vynucuje pouze Huffmanovo kodovani."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:375
msgid ""
"Compression strategy that limits match distances to one (run-length "
"encoding)."
msgstr ""
"Kompresni strategie, ktera omezuje vzdalenosti shod na jednu (run-length "
"encoding)."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:377
msgid ""
"This constant is only available if Python was compiled with zlib 1.2.0.1 or "
"greater."
msgstr ""
"Tato konstanta je k dispozici pouze pokud byl Python prelozeny se zlib "
"1.2.0.1 nebo vyssi."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:385
msgid "Compression strategy that prevents the use of dynamic Huffman codes."
msgstr ""
"Kompresni strategie, ktera zabranuji pouziti dynamickych Huffmanovych kodu."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:387 ../../library/zlib.rst:424
msgid ""
"This constant is only available if Python was compiled with zlib 1.2.2.2 or "
"greater."
msgstr ""
"Tato konstanta je k dispozici pouze pokud byl Python prelozeny se zlib "
"1.2.2.2 nebo vyssi."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:395
msgid "Flush mode ``0``. No special flushing behavior."
msgstr "Flush rezim ``0``. Zadne specialni chovani pri vyprazdnovani."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:402
msgid "Flush mode ``1``. Flush as much output as possible."
msgstr "Flush rezim ``1``. Vyprazdni co nejvice vystupu."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:407
msgid ""
"Flush mode ``2``. All output is flushed and the output is aligned to a byte "
"boundary."
msgstr ""
"Flush rezim ``2``. Vsechny vystupy jsou vyprazdneny a vystup je zarovnan na "
"hranici bytu."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:412
msgid ""
"Flush mode ``3``. All output is flushed and the compression state is reset."
msgstr ""
"Flush rezim ``3``. Vsechny vystupy jsou vyprazdneny a stav komprese je "
"resetovan."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:417
msgid ""
"Flush mode ``4``. All pending input is processed, no more input is expected."
msgstr ""
"Flush rezim ``4``. Vsechny cekajici vstupy jsou zpracovany, zadny dalsi "
"vstup se neocekava."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:422
msgid "Flush mode ``5``. A deflate block is completed and emitted."
msgstr "Flush rezim ``5``. Deflate blok je dokoncen a emitovan."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:432
msgid ""
"Flush mode ``6``, for inflate operations. Instructs inflate to return when "
"it gets to the next deflate block boundary."
msgstr ""
"Flush rezim ``6`` pro inflate operace. Instrukuje inflate, aby se vratil, "
"kdyz se dostane k dalsi hranici deflate bloku."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:435
msgid ""
"This constant is only available if Python was compiled with zlib 1.2.3.4 or "
"greater."
msgstr ""
"Tato konstanta je k dispozici pouze pokud byl Python prelozeny se zlib "
"1.2.3.4 nebo vyssi."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:441
msgid ""
"Information about the version of the zlib library in use is available "
"through the following constants:"
msgstr ""
"Informace o verzi pouzite zlib knihovny jsou k dispozici prostrednictvim "
"nasledujicich konstant:"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:447
msgid ""
"The version string of the zlib library that was used for building the "
"module. This may be different from the zlib library actually used at "
"runtime, which is available as :const:`ZLIB_RUNTIME_VERSION`."
msgstr ""
"Retezec verze zlib knihovny, ktera byla pouzita pro sestaveni modulu. Muze "
"se lisit od zlib knihovny skutecne pouzite za behu, ktera je k dispozici "
"jako :const:`ZLIB_RUNTIME_VERSION`."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:454
msgid ""
"The version string of the zlib library actually loaded by the interpreter."
msgstr "Retezec verze zlib knihovny skutecne nactene interpretem."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:461
msgid ""
"The version string of the zlib-ng library that was used for building the "
"module if zlib-ng was used. When present, the :data:`ZLIB_VERSION` and "
":data:`ZLIB_RUNTIME_VERSION` constants reflect the version of the zlib API "
"provided by zlib-ng."
msgstr ""
"Retezec verze zlib-ng knihovny, ktera byla pouzita pro sestaveni modulu, "
"pokud byla pouzita zlib-ng. Kdyz je pritomna, konstanty :data:`ZLIB_VERSION`"
" a :data:`ZLIB_RUNTIME_VERSION` odrazejí verzi zlib API poskytovane zlib-ng."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:466
msgid ""
"If zlib-ng was not used to build the module, this constant will be absent."
msgstr ""
"Pokud zlib-ng nebyla pouzita pro sestaveni modulu, tato konstanta bude "
"chybet."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:473
msgid "Module :mod:`gzip`"
msgstr "Modul :mod:`gzip`"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:474
msgid "Reading and writing :program:`gzip`\\ -format files."
msgstr "Cteni a zapis souboru ve formatu :program:`gzip`."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:476
msgid "https://www.zlib.net"
msgstr "https://www.zlib.net"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:477
msgid "The zlib library home page."
msgstr "Domovska stranka knihovny zlib."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:479
msgid "https://www.zlib.net/manual.html"
msgstr "https://www.zlib.net/manual.html"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:480
msgid ""
"The zlib manual explains  the semantics and usage of the library's many "
"functions."
msgstr "Manual zlib vysvetluje semantiku a pouziti mnoha funkci knihovny."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:483
msgid ""
"In case gzip (de)compression is a bottleneck, the `python-isal`_ package "
"speeds up (de)compression with a mostly compatible API."
msgstr ""
"V pripade, ze gzip (de)komprese je uzke hrdlo, balik `python-isal`_ "
"zrychluje (de)kompresi s vetsinou kompatibilnim API."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:118
msgid "Cyclic Redundancy Check"
msgstr "Cyklicky redundantni kontrolni soucet"

